'''Ribbo''' (ゲコック, ''Gekokku'') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Croakley]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]].

