==Enemy==
Ribbo has much lower health and range than Croakley, but has a guaranteed chance to [[warp]] cats and has a [[Barrier]] with a breaking point of 65,000. Not too differently than [[Corporal Weyland]], he warps cats from [[Long Distance]] while relying on a Barrier to keep him safe, with the main difference being an even stronger reliance on these abilities, as his very low health makes him extremely vulnerable once his Barrier is destroyed.

==Strategy==
When there is an opening to reach Ribbo, use short-ranged [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breakers]] like [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Major Space Cat]] or [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kendo Cat]] to easily break his Barrier. Unfortunately, this won't happen easily. [[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Erphuan]] and [[Gravi (Uber Rare Cat)|Gravi]] can destroy this enemy in most situations with their abilities, while [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Major Leaguer Cat]] is a non-[[:Category:Gacha Cats|gacha]] alternative. If Ribbo's frontline support is pushed back enough, it becomes possible to use the Breakerblast Cannon, then to easily dispose of him with [[Wave Attack|waves]].

