==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Gekokku (ゲコック), may be derived from 下戸 ''geko'' (someone who can't or doesn't like to drink alcohol; this word is used in Ribbo's Japanese description), げこっ ''geko'' (croak) and クック ''kukku'' (cook).
*He may be a reference to [[wikia:keroro:Keroro|Keroro]] from the manga and anime ''[[wikipedia: Sgt. Frog|Sgt. Frog]]'', as both are elite alien frogs with a yellow star on a white belly.

